{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"- (","kind":"text"},{"text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"requestProgress","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The state and progress of an inactive or completed pack are computed lazily. If","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"you need the state or progress of a pack whose ","type":"text"},{"code":"state","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property is currently","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"set to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackState\/MLNOfflinePackStateUnknown","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", observe KVO change notifications on this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pack’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"state","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" key path, then call this method. Alternatively, you can add an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"observer for ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackProgressChangedNotification","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" about this pack that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"come from the default notification center.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"requestProgress","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"requestProgress","kind":"identif